    "updated_at": "2023-04-05T04:06:23Z",
    "body": "> I think the plan is pretty clear (as described in the raw video explainer). It is now mostly a matter of prioritizing the editing and implementation work. I can probably help with the editing work.\r\n\r\nI'm not certain whether we want a new kind of controller or a flag on the existing DefaultController that enables transfers. However, if you could draft something then that would be a big help in seeing what approach is simpler.",
